---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Me" description="Learn about Joe Tanaka, the creator of Local Guide Japan">
  <main class="gh-main">
    <article class="gh-article">
      <header class="gh-article-header gh-canvas">
        <h1 class="gh-article-title">About Me</h1>
      </header>

      <section class="gh-content gh-canvas aboutme-content">
        <div class="author-profile">
          <img src="/images/profile_circle.png" alt="Joe Tanaka" class="author-image" />
          <h2>Joe Tanaka</h2>
          <p class="author-tagline">Founder of Local Guide Japan</p>

          <div class="social-links">
            <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@localguide_japan" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="YouTube">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                <path d="M19.615 3.184c-3.604-.246-11.631-.245-15.23 0-3.897.266-4.356 2.62-4.385 8.816.029 6.185.484 8.549 4.385 8.816 3.6.245 11.626.246 15.23 0 3.897-.266 4.356-2.62 4.385-8.816-.029-6.185-.484-8.549-4.385-8.816zm-10.615 12.816v-8l8 3.993-8 4.007z"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/localguide_japan" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Instagram">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                <path d="M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.919.058 1.265.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.92-.058-1.265-.07-1.644-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zm0-2.163c-3.259 0-3.667.014-4.947.072-4.358.2-6.78 2.618-6.98 6.98-.059 1.281-.073 1.689-.073 4.948 0 3.259.014 3.668.072 4.948.2 4.358 2.618 6.78 6.98 6.98 1.281.058 1.689.072 4.948.072 3.259 0 3.668-.014 4.948-.072 4.354-.2 6.782-2.618 6.979-6.98.059-1.28.073-1.689.073-4.948 0-3.259-.014-3.667-.072-4.947-.196-4.354-2.617-6.78-6.979-6.98-1.281-.059-1.69-.073-4.949-.073zm0 5.838c-3.403 0-6.162 2.759-6.162 6.162s2.759 6.163 6.162 6.163 6.162-2.759 6.162-6.163c0-3.403-2.759-6.162-6.162-6.162zm0 10.162c-2.209 0-4-1.79-4-4 0-2.209 1.791-4 4-4s4 1.791 4 4c0 2.21-1.791 4-4 4zm6.406-11.845c-.796 0-1.441.645-1.441 1.44s.645 1.44 1.441 1.44c.795 0 1.439-.645 1.439-1.44s-.644-1.44-1.439-1.44z"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@localguide_japan" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="TikTok">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                <path d="M19.59 6.69a4.83 4.83 0 0 1-3.77-4.25V2h-3.45v13.67a2.89 2.89 0 0 1-5.2 1.74 2.89 2.89 0 0 1 2.31-4.64 2.93 2.93 0 0 1 .88.13V9.4a6.84 6.84 0 0 0-1-.05A6.33 6.33 0 0 0 5 20.1a6.34 6.34 0 0 0 10.86-4.43v-7a8.16 8.16 0 0 0 4.77 1.52v-3.4a4.85 4.85 0 0 1-1-.1z"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="author-bio">
          <h3>Hello! Welcome to Local Guide Japan</h3>

          <p>I'm <strong>Joe Tanaka</strong>, a passionate traveler from Japan. My mission is to help you experience Japan in a smart, safe, and enjoyable way.</p>

          <figure class="author-photo">
            <img src="/images/profile-1.png" alt="Joe Tanaka" />
          </figure>

          <h3>My Background</h3>

          <p>I was born in <strong>Kamakura</strong> and have lived in several major Japanese cities including Tokyo (Shibuya and Ginza districts), Kyoto, and Hokkaido. I also completed high school studies abroad in the United States. My extensive travel to over 20 countries informs my perspective on what visitors need.</p>

          <h3>What I Share</h3>

          <p>Rather than sharing only picturesque imagery, I emphasize <strong>practical travel intelligence</strong>. My content covers:</p>

          <ul>
            <li>Affordable travel strategies</li>
            <li>Train and bus navigation</li>
            <li>Cultural etiquette and traditions</li>
            <li>Safety precautions</li>
            <li>Honest destination evaluations, including recommendations and places to avoid</li>
          </ul>

          <h3>My Philosophy</h3>

          <p>I aim to fill a gap in travel content by providing <strong>real, useful travel advice</strong> with specifics often missing from social media. I engage directly with followers, offering answers about souvenirs, dining, tourist pitfalls, and authentic experiences.</p>

          <h3>Connect With Me</h3>

          <p>Follow me on social media for daily tips and updates:</p>

          <ul>
            <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@localguide_japan" target="_blank" rel="noopener">YouTube: @localguide_japan</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/localguide_japan" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram: @localguide_japan</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@localguide_japan" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TikTok: @localguide_japan</a></li>
          </ul>

          <p>Thank you for visiting Local Guide Japan. I hope my content helps make your trip to Japan unforgettable!</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .aboutme-content {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .author-profile {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-light-gray);
  }

  .author-image {
    width: 180px;
    height: 180px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .author-profile h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .author-tagline {
    color: var(--color-secondary-text);
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .social-links {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .social-links a {
    color: var(--color-darker-gray);
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .social-links a:hover {
    color: var(--ghost-accent-color);
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .author-bio h3 {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .author-bio h3:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .author-photo {
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .author-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 500px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .author-bio ul {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding-left: 2rem;
  }

  .author-bio li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .author-image {
      width: 140px;
      height: 140px;
    }
  }
</style>
